    "< Prev": "< Prev",
    "<html>Pick the device, map each logical input to the physical axis/button, then use the live monitor below. When you move the physical joystick, the <b>Physical axes/buttons</b> section must react. If it reacts there but not in <b>Mapped outputs</b>, the profile mapping is wrong for the selected robot.</html>": "<html>Pick the device, map each logical input to the physical axis/button, then use the live monitor below. When you move the physical joystick, the <b>Physical axes/buttons</b> section must react. If it reacts there but not in <b>Mapped outputs</b>, the profile mapping is wrong for the selected robot.</html>",
    "<html>Use <b>NONE</b> to disable an axis and keep using the selected robot. To convert an axis to digital buttons, choose or type entries like <b>BTN:BASE_POS,BASE_NEG</b>. You can also combine sources manually, for example <b>BASE|BTN:BASE_POS,BASE_NEG</b>.</html>": "<html>Use <b>NONE</b> to disable an axis and keep using the selected robot. To convert an axis to digital buttons, choose or type entries like <b>BTN:BASE_POS,BASE_NEG</b>. You can also combine sources manually, for example <b>BASE|BTN:BASE_POS,BASE_NEG</b>.</html>",
